OL,3,GNEWSAPrince Charles cinema saved from
OL,4,Apotential closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince Charles cinema in Leicester
OL,7,FSquare has been saved from potential
OL,8,Fclosure after signing a 25-year lease.
OL,10,FIt has faced a lengthy period of
OL,11,Funcertainty following difficulties with
OL,12,Fits landlord, Zedwell LSQ Ltd, whose
OL,13,Fparent company is Criterion Capital.
OL,15,FNow the Leicester Square cult cinema
OL,16,Fhas secured the new lease with no break
OL,17,Fclause, offering it security so the
OL,18,F"projectors will keep rolling for years
OL,19,Fto come".
OL,21,FCriterion Capital has been approached
OL,22,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
